1
00:00:05,081 --> 00:00:09,683
Case 001: a prototype vanished from Lab A between 8 and 9 PM. Three suspects, three alibis.

2
00:00:09,883 --> 00:00:14,887
Every person, statement, location and investigation lives in a FalkorDB graph. Undiscovered evidence is an empty placeholder.

3
00:00:15,087 --> 00:00:19,096
The agent never sees the answer. Ground truth is sealed inside a separate simulator.

4
00:00:19,296 --> 00:00:23,382
Step 1: the agent queries the graph and scores each eligible action by expected information gain ÷ cost.

5
00:00:23,582 --> 00:00:28,987
Top pick: the Lab A door log. No badge entries, so Ben (who has a passage override) rises from 33% to 63%.

6
00:00:29,187 --> 00:00:34,615
Step 2: the main-entrance log. Ben's badge exited at 9:08 PM, but he said he left before 8:30.

7
00:00:34,815 --> 00:00:40,234
Walking times traversed in the graph make this a statement-vs-record contradiction. It is flagged, not taken as proof.

8
00:00:40,434 --> 00:00:45,727
Step 3: the new evidence changes what is worth checking next. The agent inspects the maintenance-passage log.

9
00:00:45,927 --> 00:00:50,530
Ben's override code opened the passage door into Lab A at 8:41 PM. A second contradiction joins the graph.

10
00:00:50,730 --> 00:00:57,254
97.6% confidence and three independent evidence bundles meet the stopping rule, so the agent closes the case.

11
00:00:57,454 --> 00:01:02,883
Only after closing is the simulator's ground truth unsealed. The conclusion matches it.

12
00:01:03,083 --> 00:01:08,713
Is it scripted? Seal the maintenance-passage door, which deletes one CONNECTED_TO edge in the graph.

13
00:01:08,913 --> 00:01:13,333
Passage evidence is now outside the crime scene's reach, so those actions become ineligible.

14
00:01:13,533 --> 00:01:30,865
Same evidence model, new graph: the agent plans a different third step and still reaches a supported conclusion.

15
00:01:31,065 --> 00:01:36,439
Case 002: four suspects. Seal the reading-room door and the evidence that could corroborate the leader is cut off.

16
00:01:36,639 --> 00:01:52,655
The agent investigates on its own: archive door log, badge audit, then the only witness it can still reach.

17
00:01:52,855 --> 00:01:59,065
Paradox reaches 97% on Esme but reports the case as inconclusive: no reachable evidence can independently confirm it.
